        "expression": "let wash = mix(c4 * 0.35, c5 * 0.12, smoothstep(-0.5, 0.5, p.y));\nvar acc = vec3<f32>(0.0, 0.0, 0.0);\nfor (var i = 0; i < 6; i++) {\n    let k = f32(i);\n    let freq = 3.0 + k * 1.7;\n    let ph = t * wave_speed * (0.6 + 0.25 * k) + k * 1.3;\n    let y = wave_amp * sin(p.x * freq + ph) + 0.12 * sin(p.x * freq * 0.37 - ph * 0.7) + (k - 2.5) * 0.12;\n    let d = abs(p.y - y);\n    let line = 1.0 - smoothstep(0.0, 0.006, d);\n    let halo_v = exp(-d * 22.0);\n    let col = mix(mix(c1, c2, k * 0.2), c3, step(3.5, k));\n    acc += col * (line * 1.2 + halo_v * 0.35 * glow_amount);\n}\nlet color = tonemap(wash + acc * glow_amount);\nreturn mix(bg, color, strength);",
